$MESS['ONETRACE_OPTIONS_LOYALTY_HINT'] = 'The loyalty program of the platform: signed-in customers pay for part of the order with points at checkout (sale.order.ajax). "Payment with points" adds a payment of the "Bonus points" pay system to the order (the module creates it inactive), catalog prices and discounts stay as they are, the platform gets the amount paid with money. "Discount on the order lines" spreads the discount over the lines of the order. The balance and the history — the onetrace:loyalty.account component in the personal section. The secret key needs the loyalty.read and loyalty.write permissions.';
