$MESS['ONETRACE_OPTIONS_STORE_MCP_HEADING'] = 'AI chat bot: store MCP';
$MESS['ONETRACE_OPTIONS_STORE_MCP'] = 'Connect to the chat bot';
$MESS['ONETRACE_OPTIONS_STORE_MCP_HINT'] = 'The AI bot of the OneTrace chat answers customers with live store data — order status, tracking, stock, delivery, returns — and, if you allow it, cancels unpaid orders and passes return and delivery change requests to the store. Customers are confirmed by the login on the site or by a code the store sends by email (the mail event ONETRACE_STORE_MCP_CODE; a handler of the onetrace.connector:onStoreMcpSendCode event can send it by SMS). Saving connects the site to the bot of the project (Chats → Chat settings → Bot → Store MCP). The secret key needs the chats.manage permission; the AI chat is paid from the balance of the project.';
